  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Rank six Immortal Gu Luck Plan is the core of the luck path killer move Luck Plan Strategy. The move belongs to luck path but has wisdom path effect. Luck plan Immortal Gu’s power is to make deductions on how to optimize the use of the Gu Immortal’s resources, while Luck Plan Strategy specializes in making battle tactics. Ordinary Gu Immortals cultivate one path and rarely take a second, so many killer moves mimic other paths. Those moves are built with limited foundation in the mimicked path: they can be strong, yet they are easily countered and their weaknesses are obvious. Compared with actual wisdom path methods, they are less useful.",
        "chapters": [
          1781
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan gains Luck Plan Strategy along with mature bamboo chest. His wisdom path methods are already plentiful, so he does not need either move; he only practises them to increase his understanding of the Genesis Lotus true inheritances and Giant Sun’s true inheritance.",
        "chapters": [
          1781
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
